    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/kiwigrid/k8s-sidecar/releases/tag/2.14.1"/>
    <title>v2.14.1</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;📦 Dependencies&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;build(deps): bump kubernetes from 35.0.0 to 36.0.3
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PR: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5740901972&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/kiwigrid/k8s-sidecar/issues/640&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/kiwigrid/k8s-sidecar/pull/640/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/kiwigrid/k8s-sidecar/pull/640&quot;&gt;#640&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;ℹ️ Notes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;kubernetes&lt;/code&gt; 36 ships an additional asyncio client and makes &lt;code&gt;aiohttp&lt;/code&gt; a required dependency, although the sidecar only uses the synchronous client. As a result, the image now also contains &lt;code&gt;aiohttp&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;multidict&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;yarl&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;frozenlist&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;propcache&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;aiosignal&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;aiohappyeyeballs&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;attrs&lt;/code&gt;, which you will see in SBOMs and vulnerability scans. The image grows from about 85 MB to 116 MB unpacked (25 → 29 MB compressed, amd64).&lt;/p&gt;</content>
